          "id": "india-cyclone-murasu-2026-11-01",
          "headline": "Cyclone Murasu set to hit south Andhra coast overnight; Odisha on alert",
          "summary": "The storm over the Bay of Bengal has winds of 100 to 110 km/h and is expected to cross the south Andhra Pradesh coast as a very severe cyclonic storm between midnight on 2 November and early 3 November, according to IMD. Andhra Pradesh has deployed six NDRF and seven SDRF teams and ordered evacuations, and fishermen in both states have been told to stay ashore.",
          "why_it_matters": "Landfall could disrupt homes, crops and ports along the east coast this week.",
          "importance": 5,
          "lead": false,
